1
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,380
Hold on a second, son.

2
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,240
What brings you up here this early?

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,000
I'm going to the abbey.

4
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:11,040
Brother Sammuel sent for me.

5
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,760
Here's his letter.

6
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,240
Yep, that's the abbey's seal, all right.

7
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,680
Go on through. And stick to the road.

8
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,340
It's not safe off it these days.

9
00:00:43,625 --> 00:00:47,085
Hey! You! Help me!

10
00:00:51,605 --> 00:00:53,865
You're bleeding. Here, lean on me.

11
00:00:54,705 --> 00:00:56,025
Get me to the abbey.

12
00:00:56,345 --> 00:00:57,885
Brother Sammuel can stop the bleeding.

13
00:00:58,205 --> 00:00:59,945
And there's a woman trapped in the vineyard.

14
00:01:00,085 --> 00:01:00,925
Hurry.

15
00:01:01,005 --> 00:01:02,045
I'm going to the abbey too.

16
00:01:02,125 --> 00:01:03,325
Come on.

17
00:01:12,875 --> 00:01:15,095
Brother! This man is hurt.

18
00:01:15,175 --> 00:01:16,375
Where is Brother Sammuel?

19
00:01:17,615 --> 00:01:19,095
In the Hall of Arms.

20
00:01:19,315 --> 00:01:20,955
That way, through the side door.

21
00:01:21,035 --> 00:01:22,235
I'll come with you.

